  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: TOCTOU in restricted mount target resolution allows a\n     local user with an fstab \"user\" entry to redirect the mount to a\n     root-owned location and gain root privileges\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-53613.patch: pin the target of non-root mounts\n       with an O_PATH descriptor that refuses symlinks in any path component,\n       take the canonical target from the pinned descriptor instead of\n       resolving it with root privileges, and pass /proc/self/fd/<fd> of the\n       pinned target and bind/move source to mount(2) in libmount\n     - CVE-2026-53613",
